<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
  <link rel="icon" href="data:image/jpeg;base64," />
  <meta name="description" content="Custom AI-generated template for: ""Generate a complete, mobile-first Restaurant & Grocery PWA with a WhatsApp QR-Code Ordering System built in single-page HTML, Tailwind CSS, and vanilla JavaScript. Include a manifest.json and a sw.js (Service Worker) so it can be installed on phones directly from the browser.  1. Application Requirements Header & Location Bar: Display a slick emerald/green header #059669 with the brand name 'Fresh Bites' and a dynamic badge showing the scanned location captured from URL query parameters (e.g., ?table=Table05 or ?address=HomeDelivery). Default to Table #01 if no parameter is passed.  Category Toggle: A tab switcher allowing users to toggle between 🍔 Restaurant Menu and 🥦 Grocery Store.  Interactive Cart System:  Add to Cart, Increment, Decrement, and Remove items dynamically.  Calculate subtotal, taxes (5%), and final order total in real-time.  Customer Input Modal / Checkout:  Ask for Customer Name, Table Number / Delivery Address, and Special Cooking/Delivery Notes.  Allow configuring the owner's receiving WhatsApp Phone Number via an editable setting or fallback parameter.  WhatsApp Redirect Engine:  Formats the cart list cleanly into Markdown bold text (e.g., *Location:* Table #05\n*Items:* ...).  Encodes the URL payload and launches [https://wa.me/](https://wa.me/){phone}?text={encoded_message} in a new tab.  2. PWA Specification manifest.json: Set display: "standalone", name: 'Fresh Bites QR Ordering', start_url: "/?table=Table01", theme_color: "#059669", and high-resolution PWA app icons.  sw.js: Include an active Service Worker with install, activate, and fetch event listeners to cache essential static assets for offline responsiveness.  PWA Registration: Include inline JavaScript inside <head> to automatically register /sw.js on page load.  Build all three files (index.html, manifest.json, and sw.js) so they can be deployed instantly to Cloudflare Pages in 1 click.""" />
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>"Generate a complete, mobile-first Resta</title>
  
  <!-- PWA Meta Tags -->
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#059669">
  <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
  <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black-translucent">
  <link rel="manifest" href="manifest.json">
  
  <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>

  <!-- Google Fonts -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <!-- FontAwesome Icons -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">

  
  


  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-950 dark:text-slate-100 font-sans antialiased transition-colors duration-300">

  <!-- Top Navigation Bar -->
  <header class="sticky top-0 z-40 bg-emerald-600 dark:bg-emerald-900 text-white shadow-md transition-colors duration-300">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between h-16">
        
        <!-- Brand Logo -->
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
          <div class="bg-white text-emerald-600 p-2 rounded-xl shadow-inner flex items-center justify-center">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-utensils text-xl"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="font-display font-extrabold text-xl tracking-tight block">Fresh Bites</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-emerald-100 font-medium tracking-wider uppercase">QR Order & Shop</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Dynamic Location Badge -->
        <div class="hidden sm:flex items-center bg-emerald-700/50 dark:bg-emerald-950/40 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/30 text-sm font-medium">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot text-emerald-300 mr-2 animate-bounce"></i>
          <span id="location-badge-desktop">Loading Location...</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Side Actions -->
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
          <!-- Dark Mode Toggle -->
          <button id="theme-toggle" class="p-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-emerald-700 dark:hover:bg-emerald-800 transition-colors" title="Toggle Dark Mode">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-moon text-lg block dark:hidden"></i>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-sun text-lg hidden dark:block"></i>
          </button>

          <!-- PWA Install Button -->
          <button id="pwa-install-btn" class="hidden bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-600 text-slate-950 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-bold items-center space-x-1 transition-all shadow-sm">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-download"></i>
            <span>Install App</span>
          </button>

          <!-- Developer PWA Files Button -->
          <button onclick="togglePwaModal(true)" class="p-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-emerald-700 dark:hover:bg-emerald-800 transition-colors" title="PWA Assets & Setup">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-laptop-code text-lg"></i>
          </button>

          <!-- Cart Trigger Button -->
          <button onclick="toggleCart(true)" class="relative p-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-emerald-700 dark:hover:bg-emerald-800 transition-colors">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-basket-shopping text-xl"></i>
            <span id="cart-count-badge" class="absolute -top-1 -right-1 bg-rose-500 text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-full h-5 w-5 flex items-center justify-center scale-0 transition-transform duration-300">0</span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Mobile Location Bar -->
    <div class="sm:hidden bg-emerald-700 dark:bg-emerald-950 px-4 py-2 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-medium border-t border-emerald-500/20">
      <div class="flex items-center">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot text-emerald-300 mr-1.5"></i>
        <span id="location-badge-mobile">Loading Location...</span>
      </div>
      <button onclick="openSettingsModal()" class="text-emerald-200 hover:text-white flex items-center space-x-1">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-gear"></i>
        <span>Settings</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Main Content Container -->
  <main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-6 pb-24">
    
    <!-- Hero Banner & Search -->
    <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-600 to-teal-600 dark:from-emerald-900 dark:to-teal-900 text-white p-6 sm:p-8 mb-8 shadow-lg">
      <div class="absolute -right-10 -bottom-10 opacity-10 text-9xl">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-burger"></i>
      </div>
      <div class="relative z-10 max-w-2xl">
        <span class="bg-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-100 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-emerald-400/20">Instant QR Ordering</span>
        <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-display font-extrabold mt-3 mb-2">Delicious Food & Fresh Groceries, Delivered Instantly.</h1>
        <p class="text-emerald-100 text-sm sm:text-base mb-6">Scan, select, and order directly to your table or doorstep via WhatsApp. Fast, contactless, and secure.</p>
        
        <!-- Search Bar -->
        <div class="relative max-w-md">
          <span class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 flex items-center pl-3 pointer-events-none text-slate-400">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass"></i>
          </span>
          <input type="text" id="search-input" oninput="handleSearch(this.value)" placeholder="Search delicious dishes or fresh groceries..." class="w-full pl-10 pr-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 placeholder-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-400 shadow-md transition-all">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Category Switcher (Restaurant vs Grocery) -->
    <div class="flex p-1 bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl max-w-md mx-auto mb-8 shadow-inner">
      <button onclick="switchTab('restaurant')" id="tab-restaurant" class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-center space-x-2 py-3 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold transition-all duration-300 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 shadow-sm">
        <span>🍔</span>
        <span>Restaurant Menu</span>
      </button>
      <button onclick="switchTab('grocery')" id="tab-grocery" class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-center space-x-2 py-3 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold transition-all duration-300 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-800 dark:hover:text-slate-200">
        <span>🥦</span>
        <span>Grocery Store</span>
      </button>
    </div>

    <!-- Sub-category Chips (Horizontal Scrollable) -->
    <div class="mb-6 overflow-x-auto no-scrollbar flex space-x-2 pb-2" id="subcategory-container">
      <!-- Dynamic chips injected here -->
    </div>

    <!-- Dynamic Section Title -->
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
      <h2 id="section-title" class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-white">Restaurant Menu</h2>
      <span id="items-count" class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-medium">Loading items...</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Product Grid -->
    <div id="product-grid" class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      <!-- Dynamic product cards injected here -->
    </div>

    <!-- Empty State (Hidden by default) -->
    <div id="empty-state" class="hidden flex-col items-center justify-center py-16 text-center">
      <div class="bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-900 p-6 rounded-full text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-600 mb-4">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-box-open text-5xl"></i>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">No items found</h3>
      <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-500 text-sm max-w-xs mt-1">Try adjusting your search or category filters to find what you're looking for.</p>
    </div>

  </main>

  <!-- Floating Action Button (Mobile Cart) -->
  <div class="fixed bottom-6 right-6 z-30 sm:hidden">
    <button onclick="toggleCart(true)" class="bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white p-4 rounded-full shadow-2xl flex items-center justify-center relative animate-pulse-soft">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-basket-shopping text-2xl"></i>
      <span id="cart-count-badge-mobile" class="absolute -top-1 -right-1 bg-rose-500 text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-full h-6 w-6 flex items-center justify-center">0</span>
    </button>
  </div>

  <!-- Cart Drawer (Slide-over) -->
  <div id="cart-drawer" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none hidden" role="dialog" aria-modal="true">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden">
      <!-- Backdrop -->
      <div onclick="toggleCart(false)" class="absolute inset-0 bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-sm transition-opacity pointer-events-auto"></div>

      <div class="pointer-events-none fixed inset-y-0 right-0 flex max-w-full pl-10">
        <div class="pointer-events-auto w-screen max-w-md transform transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out">
          <div class="flex h-full flex-col bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 shadow-2xl">
            
            <!-- Drawer Header -->
            <div class="px-4 py-6 sm:px-6 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 bg-emerald-600 dark:bg-emerald-900 text-white">
              <div class="flex items-start justify-between">
                <h2 class="text-lg font-bold font-display flex items-center">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-basket-shopping mr-2"></i> Your Order Basket
                </h2>
                <div class="ml-3 flex h-7 items-center">
                  <button type="button" onclick="toggleCart(false)" class="relative -m-2 p-2 text-emerald-100 hover:text-white focus:outline-none">
                    <span class="sr-only">Close panel</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-xl"></i>
                  </button>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="mt-2 flex items-center text-xs text-emerald-100">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot mr-1"></i>
                <span id="cart-location-text">Table #01</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Drawer Body (Cart Items) -->
            <div class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto px-4 py-6 sm:px-6" id="cart-items-container">
              <!-- Dynamic cart items injected here -->
            </div>

            <!-- Drawer Footer (Totals & Checkout Button) -->
            <div class="border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 px-4 py-6 sm:px-6 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/50">
              <div class="space-y-1.5 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
                <div class="flex justify-between">
                  <span>Subtotal</span>
                  <span id="cart-subtotal" class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-white">$0.00</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between">
                  <span>Tax (5%)</span>
                  <span id="cart-tax" class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-white">$0.00</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white pt-2 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
                  <span>Total Amount</span>
                  <span id="cart-total" class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">$0.00</span>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="mt-6">
                <button onclick="openCheckoutModal()" id="checkout-btn" disabled class="w-full flex items-center justify-center justify-between bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 disabled:bg-slate-300 dark:disabled:bg-slate-800 disabled:cursor-not-allowed text-white px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl font-bold shadow-lg transition-all">
                  <span>Proceed to Checkout</span>
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
                </button>
              </div>
              <div class="mt-4 text-center">
                <button onclick="toggleCart(false)" class="text-sm font-medium text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-500 dark:text-emerald-400 dark:hover:text-emerald-300">
                  Continue Shopping
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Customization Modal (Item Variations & Options) -->
  <div id="customization-modal" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 overflow-y-auto hidden" aria-labelledby="modal-title" role="dialog" aria-modal="true">
    <div class="flex items-end justify-center min-h-screen pt-4 px-4 pb-20 text-center sm:block sm:p-0">
      <!-- Backdrop -->
      <div onclick="closeCustomizationModal()" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-sm transition-opacity"></div>

      <!-- Modal panel -->
      <span class="hidden sm:inline-block sm:align-middle sm:h-screen" aria-hidden="true">&#8203;</span>
      <div class="inline-block align-bottom bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl text-left overflow-hidden shadow-2xl transform transition-all sm:my-8 sm:align-middle sm:max-w-lg sm:w-full border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800">
        
        <!-- Modal Header -->
        <div class="relative h-48 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 overflow-hidden">
          <img id="custom-modal-image" src="" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
          <button onclick="closeCustomizationModal()" class="absolute top-4 right-4 bg-slate-900/60 hover:bg-slate-900/80 text-white rounded-full p-2 transition-colors">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-lg"></i>
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6">
          <span id="custom-modal-subcategory" class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">Category</span>
          <h3 id="custom-modal-title" class="text-xl font-bold font-display text-slate-800 dark:text-white mt-1">Product Name</h3>
          <p id="custom-modal-description" class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-xs mt-1.5 leading-relaxed">Product description goes here.</p>

          <!-- Dynamic Options Container -->
          <div id="custom-options-container" class="mt-6 space-y-6 max-h-60 overflow-y-auto pr-1">
            <!-- Dynamic options injected here -->
          </div>

          <!-- Footer with Quantity & Add Button -->
          <div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-1">
              <button onclick="adjustCustomQty(-1)" class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-slate-700 text-slate-800 dark:text-white hover:bg-slate-200 dark:hover:bg-slate-600 transition-colors shadow-sm">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-minus text-xs"></i>
              </button>
              <span id="custom-qty-display" class="px-4 text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-white">1</span>
              <button onclick="adjustCustomQty(1)" class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-slate-700 text-slate-800 dark:text-white hover:bg-slate-200 dark:hover:bg-slate-600 transition-colors shadow-sm">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-plus text-xs"></i>
              </button>
            </div>

            <button onclick="confirmCustomization()" class="flex-1 ml-4 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white py-3 px-6 rounded-xl font-bold shadow-lg transition-all flex items-center justify-between">
              <span>Add to Basket</span>
              <span id="custom-total-price" class="font-extrabold">$0.00</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Checkout Modal -->
  <div id="checkout-modal" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 overflow-y-auto hidden" aria-labelledby="modal-title" role="dialog" aria-modal="true">
    <div class="flex items-end justify-center min-h-screen pt-4 px-4 pb-20 text-center sm:block sm:p-0">
      <!-- Backdrop -->
      <div onclick="closeCheckoutModal()" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-sm transition-opacity"></div>

      <!-- Modal panel -->
      <span class="hidden sm:inline-block sm:align-middle sm:h-screen" aria-hidden="true">&#8203;</span>
      <div class="inline-block align-bottom bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl text-left overflow-hidden shadow-2xl transform transition-all sm:my-8 sm:align-middle sm:max-w-lg sm:w-full border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800">
        
        <!-- Modal Header -->
        <div class="bg-emerald-600 dark:bg-emerald-900 text-white px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-display flex items-center">
            <i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp mr-2 text-xl"></i> Complete WhatsApp Order
          </h3>
          <button onclick="closeCheckoutModal()" class="text-emerald-100 hover:text-white">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-lg"></i>
          </button>
        </div>

        <!-- Modal Form -->
        <form id="checkout-form" onsubmit="submitOrder(event)" class="p-6 space-y-4">
          
          <!-- Order Type Selector -->
          <div>
            <label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-2">Order Type</label>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 p-1 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl">
              <button type="button" onclick="setOrderType('dine-in')" id="type-dine-in" class="py-2 text-xs font-bold rounded-lg transition-all bg-white dark:bg-slate-700 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 shadow-sm">Dine-In</button>
              <button type="button" onclick="setOrderType('takeaway')" id="type-takeaway" class="py-2 text-xs font-bold rounded-lg transition-all text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Takeaway</button>
              <button type="button" onclick="setOrderType('delivery')" id="type-delivery" class="py-2 text-xs font-bold rounded-lg transition-all text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Delivery</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Customer Name -->
          <div>
            <label for="customer-name" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-1">Your Name *</label>
            <input type="text" id="customer-name" required placeholder="e.g., John Doe" class="w-full px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500">
            <p id="name-error" class="text-xs text-rose-500 mt-1 hidden">Please enter a valid name (at least 2 characters).</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Customer Phone Number -->
          <div>
            <label for="customer-phone" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-1">Your Phone Number *</label>
            <input type="tel" id="customer-phone" required placeholder="e.g., +15551234567" class="w-full px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500">
            <p id="phone-error" class="text-xs text-rose-500 mt-1 hidden">Please enter a valid phone number (7 to 15 digits).</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Dynamic Location / Address Input -->
          <div id="location-input-container">
            <label id="location-label" for="customer-location" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-1">Table Number *</label>
            <input type="text" id="customer-location" required placeholder="e.g., Table #05" class="w-full px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500">
            <p id="location-error" class="text-xs text-rose-500 mt-1 hidden">This field is required.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Special Notes -->
          <div>
            <label for="order-notes" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-1">Special Cooking / Delivery Notes</label>
            <textarea id="order-notes" rows="3" placeholder="e.g., No onions, extra spicy, leave at door..." class="w-full px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500"></textarea>
          </div>

          <!-- Order Summary Box -->
          <div class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/50 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-sm mb-2">
              <span class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Order Type:</span>
              <span id="summary-order-type" class="font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-white capitalize">Dine-In</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-sm">
              <span class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Order Total:</span>
              <span id="modal-order-total" class="font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 text-lg">$0.00</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Submit Button -->
          <button type="submit" class="w-full flex items-center justify-center space-x-2 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white py-3.5 rounded-xl font-bold shadow-lg transition-all">
            <i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp text-xl"></i>
            <span>Send Order via WhatsApp</span>
          </button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Settings Modal (WhatsApp Config) -->
  <div id="settings-modal" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 overflow-y-auto hidden" aria-labelledby="modal-title" role="dialog" aria-modal="true">
    <div class="flex items-end justify-center min-h-screen pt-4 px-4 pb-20 text-center sm:block sm:p-0">
      <div onclick="closeSettingsModal()" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-sm transition-opacity"></div>
      <span class="hidden sm:inline-block sm:align-middle sm:h-screen" aria-hidden="true">&#8203;</span>
      <div class="inline-block align-bottom bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl text-left overflow-hidden shadow-2xl transform transition-all sm:my-8 sm:align-middle sm:max-w-md sm:w-full border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800">
        <div class="bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-display text-slate-800 dark:text-white flex items-center">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-gear mr-2"></i> Merchant Settings
          </h3>
          <button onclick="closeSettingsModal()" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800 dark:hover:text-white">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-lg"></i>
          </button>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 space-y-4">
          <div>
            <label for="merchant-phone" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-1">Receiving WhatsApp Number *</label>
            <input type="text" id="merchant-phone" placeholder="e.g., 1234567890" class="w-full px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500">
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Include country code without '+' or spaces (e.g., 15551234567).</p>
            <p id="merchant-phone-error" class="text-xs text-rose-500 mt-1 hidden">Please enter a valid merchant phone number.</p>
          </div>
          <button onclick="saveSettings()" class="w-full bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold transition-all">
            Save Settings
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- PWA Assets & Setup Modal (Developer Panel) -->
  <div id="pwa-modal" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 overflow-y-auto hidden" aria-labelledby="modal-title" role="dialog" aria-modal="true">
    <div class="flex items-end justify-center min-h-screen pt-4 px-4 pb-20 text-center sm:block sm:p-0">
      <div onclick="togglePwaModal(false)" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-sm transition-opacity"></div>
      <span class="hidden sm:inline-block sm:align-middle sm:h-screen" aria-hidden="true">&#8203;</span>
      <div class="inline-block align-bottom bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl text-left overflow-hidden shadow-2xl transform transition-all sm:my-8 sm:align-middle sm:max-w-3xl sm:w-full border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800">
        
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-display text-slate-800 dark:text-white flex items-center">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-laptop-code mr-2 text-emerald-600"></i> PWA Assets & Cloudflare Deployment
          </h3>
          <button onclick="togglePwaModal(false)" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800 dark:hover:text-white">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-lg"></i>
          </button>
        </div>

        <!-- Content -->
        <div class="p-6 space-y-6 max-h-[70vh] overflow-y-auto">
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
            To deploy this application as a fully installable Progressive Web App (PWA) on Cloudflare Pages, download or copy the following files and place them in the same root directory as your <code class="bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-rose-500">index.html</code>.
          </p>

          <!-- Manifest.json Section -->
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">1. manifest.json</span>
              <button onclick="downloadFile('manifest.json', getManifestContent())" class="text-xs bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg font-semibold flex items-center space-x-1">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-download"></i>
                <span>Download</span>
              </button>
            </div>
            <pre class="bg-slate-950 text-emerald-400 p-4 rounded-xl text-xs overflow-x-auto font-mono max-h-40 border border-slate-800"><code>{
  "name": "Fresh Bites QR Ordering",
  "short_name": "Fresh Bites",
  "description": "Order delicious food and fresh groceries directly via WhatsApp.",
  "start_url": "/?table=Table01",
  "display": "standalone",
  "background_color": "#ffffff",
  "theme_color": "#059669",
  "icons": [
    {
      "src": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1565299624946-b28f40a0ae38?auto=format&fit=crop&w=192&h=192&q=80",
      "sizes": "192x192",
      "type": "image/jpeg"
    },
    {
      "src": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1565299624946-b28f40a0ae38?auto=format&fit=crop&w=512&h=512&q=80",
      "sizes": "512x512",
      "type": "image/jpeg"
    }
  ]
}</code></pre>
          </div>

          <!-- sw.js Section -->
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">2. sw.js (Service Worker)</span>
              <button onclick="downloadFile('sw.js', getServiceWorkerContent())" class="text-xs bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg font-semibold flex items-center space-x-1">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-download"></i>
                <span>Download</span>
              </button>
            </div>
            <pre class="bg-slate-950 text-emerald-400 p-4 rounded-xl text-xs overflow-x-auto font-mono max-h-40 border border-slate-800"><code>const CACHE_NAME = 'fresh-bites-v1';
const ASSETS = [
  '/',
  '/index.html',
  '/manifest.json'
];

self.addEventListener('install', (e) => {
  e.waitUntil(
    caches.open(CACHE_NAME).then((cache) => {
      return cache.addAll(ASSETS);
    })
  );
});

self.addEventListener('activate', (e) => {
  e.waitUntil(
    caches.keys().then((keys) => {
      return Promise.all(
        keys.map((key) => {
          if (key !== CACHE_NAME) {
            return caches.delete(key);
          }
        })
      );
    })
  );
});

self.addEventListener('fetch', (e) => {
  e.respondWith(
    caches.match(e.request).then((cachedResponse) => {
      return cachedResponse || fetch(e.request);
    })
  );
});</code></pre>
          </div>

          <!-- Cloudflare Instructions -->
          <div class="bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/30 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-emerald-100 dark:border-emerald-900/50">
            <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-300 flex items-center mb-1">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info mr-2"></i> 1-Click Deployment Guide
            </h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 leading-relaxed">
              Simply place <code class="font-bold">index.html</code>, <code class="font-bold">manifest.json</code>, and <code class="font-bold">sw.js</code> in a folder, drag-and-drop it into Cloudflare Pages, and your fully functional, offline-capable, installable WhatsApp QR Ordering PWA is live!
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- JavaScript State & Logic -->
  
  


  <script src="script.js"></script>

  <!-- Built by UniLog AI Watermark -->
