    <span style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 4px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00f2fe, #4facfe); color: #0f172a; font-weight: 900; font-size: 9px;">U</span>
    <span>Built by UniLog AI</span>
